            Model Review
          </span>
          <span class="bg-green-500 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
            Updated October 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          AssaultRunner Pro <span class="text-[#5AA9FF]">Treadmill Review</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          The AssaultRunner Pro is the curved, motorless treadmill most home buyers picture when they think of the category. It is a running tool first, priced like a premium motorised machine, and the right buy only for a fairly specific kind of runner. This review sets out what Assault confirms, where the published figures disagree, and who should spend the money.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
