          <a href="#warranty-and-stock" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">7. Warranty, Price and Stock</a>
          <a href="#space-and-delivery" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">8. Space, Delivery and Moving It</a>
          <a href="#classic-and-elite" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">9. AssaultRunner Pro vs Classic and Elite</a>
          <a href="#alternatives" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">10. Alternatives Worth Comparing</a>
          <a href="#who-should-buy" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">11. Who Should Buy the AssaultRunner Pro</a>
